1
00:00:14,740 --> 00:00:18,270
♪I stretch and yawn
when the sun is high in the sky♪

2
00:00:19,170 --> 00:00:23,030
♪A cup of tea and a little tune,
what a carefree life♪

3
00:00:23,890 --> 00:00:28,480
♪The fortune teller said
love would come my way this year♪

4
00:00:28,740 --> 00:00:32,580
♪But all I see is my food
arriving right on time♪

5
00:00:33,850 --> 00:00:35,670
♪No rush, no worries♪

6
00:00:35,670 --> 00:00:38,360
♪Love is all a matter of chance♪

7
00:00:38,640 --> 00:00:40,480
♪Flowers bloom and fade♪

8
00:00:40,480 --> 00:00:43,380
♪I'd rather take good care
of myself first♪

9
00:00:43,380 --> 00:00:45,580
♪Two orioles sing among
the green willows♪

10
00:00:45,800 --> 00:00:47,970
♪And I still don't have a boyfriend♪

11
00:00:48,180 --> 00:00:50,590
♪My best years are nothing
to worry about♪

12
00:00:50,590 --> 00:00:53,240
♪I'll stay happily single
till I'm old and gray♪

13
00:01:02,700 --> 00:01:07,540
=Besties' Coming Fortune=

14
00:01:07,580 --> 00:01:09,980
=Episode 13=

15
00:01:10,150 --> 00:01:10,590
Move aside!

16
00:01:10,590 --> 00:01:12,100
(Zuixian Restaurant)

17
00:01:15,680 --> 00:01:16,030
Move aside.

18
00:01:16,180 --> 00:01:17,130
We need to inspect the carriage.

19
00:01:17,790 --> 00:01:18,590
If you don't move,

20
00:01:19,020 --> 00:01:20,100
you'll be charged
with obstructing official duties.

21
00:01:20,100 --> 00:01:20,900
(Zuixian Restaurant)

22
00:01:21,480 --> 00:01:22,200
Don't you...

23
00:01:22,350 --> 00:01:23,030
Who wants to see me?

24
00:01:30,070 --> 00:01:30,790
The Third Prince.

25
00:01:31,280 --> 00:01:32,230
Does His Highness have further orders?

26
00:01:37,310 --> 00:01:38,480
His Highness is concerned about you,

27
00:01:39,040 --> 00:01:39,590
so he sent me

28
00:01:39,710 --> 00:01:40,150
to check on you.

29
00:01:40,920 --> 00:01:42,310
I simply had a little too much to drink.

30
00:01:42,760 --> 00:01:43,560
I just needed some fresh air.

31
00:01:44,480 --> 00:01:45,590
Please inform His Highness

32
00:01:46,840 --> 00:01:47,560
that my wife and I

33
00:01:47,950 --> 00:01:48,790
have plans tonight,

34
00:01:49,400 --> 00:01:50,360
so we'll take our leave.

35
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:54,360
Let's go.

36
00:01:54,460 --> 00:01:56,780
(Zuixian Restaurant)

37
00:02:02,430 --> 00:02:03,000
Your Lordship.

38
00:02:03,680 --> 00:02:04,790
Investigate the Third Prince.

39
00:02:05,640 --> 00:02:05,920
Yes.

40
00:02:08,800 --> 00:02:09,640
That's the end of the story.

41
00:02:10,590 --> 00:02:11,480
If you were in that situation,

42
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:12,880
what would you choose?

43
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:16,390
What a ridiculous story.

44
00:02:17,650 --> 00:02:18,630
If Heaven wants someone to marry her,

45
00:02:18,630 --> 00:02:19,640
let Heaven marry her itself.

46
00:02:20,360 --> 00:02:20,920
All I know is

47
00:02:21,630 --> 00:02:22,600
whoever I love

48
00:02:23,190 --> 00:02:24,320
is the one I'm destined to be with.

49
00:02:26,680 --> 00:02:27,200
What about you?

50
00:02:28,050 --> 00:02:28,890
If you were in that situation,

51
00:02:31,400 --> 00:02:32,040
what would you do?

52
00:02:36,630 --> 00:02:37,650
That ring-toss stall

53
00:02:37,650 --> 00:02:38,780
looks pretty good.

54
00:02:39,750 --> 00:02:40,760
Lin Shutiao.

55
00:02:40,760 --> 00:02:41,910
It's pitch-pot.

56
00:02:42,560 --> 00:02:43,240
Hey, miss.

57
00:02:43,430 --> 00:02:44,560
Would you like to try pitch-pot?

58
00:02:44,900 --> 00:02:46,150
(Get two out of three throws in)
Get two out of three throws in,

59
00:02:46,150 --> 00:02:47,230
(to choose any prize)
and you can choose any prize.

60
00:02:49,190 --> 00:02:49,790
I want that one.

61
00:02:50,430 --> 00:02:51,230
The men's hair ribbon.

62
00:02:51,800 --> 00:02:52,550
(That color)

63
00:02:52,800 --> 00:02:53,560
(actually goes quite well)

64
00:02:53,560 --> 00:02:54,540
(with what I'm wearing today.)

65
00:02:55,520 --> 00:02:56,950
(Is she getting me a gift?)

66
00:02:57,400 --> 00:02:59,270
(Does she feel she's been
too cold to me before)

67
00:02:59,680 --> 00:03:00,600
(and wants to make it up to me?)

68
00:03:01,590 --> 00:03:02,160
Well,

69
00:03:02,840 --> 00:03:03,440
let me help you.

70
00:03:04,360 --> 00:03:05,710
You think I can't do it?

71
00:03:09,520 --> 00:03:10,040
Nice!

72
00:03:10,310 --> 00:03:10,790
Good!

73
00:03:15,080 --> 00:03:15,390
Hmph.

74
00:03:17,960 --> 00:03:18,390
Nice!

75
00:03:19,240 --> 00:03:20,510
Miss, you've got excellent aim!

76
00:03:21,030 --> 00:03:21,550
As for the prizes,

77
00:03:21,680 --> 00:03:22,000
the fans,

78
00:03:22,000 --> 00:03:22,510
sachets,

79
00:03:22,710 --> 00:03:23,400
and hair ribbons,

80
00:03:23,400 --> 00:03:24,080
take your pick.

81
00:03:24,710 --> 00:03:25,640
(Here it comes.)

82
00:03:26,240 --> 00:03:28,360
(Is this the love token
I've read about in romance novels?)

83
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:29,360
Here you go.

84
00:03:29,360 --> 00:03:31,270
(If she hands it to me with a blush,)

85
00:03:31,630 --> 00:03:33,080
(should I accept it right away)

86
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:35,230
(or play hard to get first?)

87
00:03:35,910 --> 00:03:37,770
These are so adorable.

88
00:03:39,750 --> 00:03:41,110
You two are coming with me from now on.

89
00:03:42,080 --> 00:03:43,510
(They're not for me?)

90
00:03:44,470 --> 00:03:46,000
(I'm the Third Young Master
of the Marquis's Manor,)

91
00:03:46,000 --> 00:03:46,930
(yet in her eyes, I'm worth less than)

92
00:03:46,930 --> 00:03:48,480
(two ugly clay dolls?)

93
00:03:49,310 --> 00:03:49,880
Look.

94
00:03:50,190 --> 00:03:51,440
Don't they look just like Yuyuan and me?

95
00:03:51,800 --> 00:03:52,560
I'm going to put them

96
00:03:52,560 --> 00:03:53,640
by my bedside

97
00:03:53,870 --> 00:03:54,550
and look at them every day.

98
00:03:54,960 --> 00:03:55,390
They do.

99
00:03:56,470 --> 00:03:57,270
They look exactly like you.

100
00:03:58,430 --> 00:03:58,990
One

101
00:03:59,360 --> 00:04:00,190
captures your foolish charm,

102
00:04:00,190 --> 00:04:01,390
and the other has its own foolish look.

103
00:04:01,750 --> 00:04:02,710
Such perfect likenesses.

104
00:04:03,190 --> 00:04:03,950
They look so lifelike.

105
00:04:04,080 --> 00:04:05,270
Why are you being so sarcastic?

106
00:04:06,120 --> 00:04:07,270
Shen He, where are you going?

107
00:04:07,680 --> 00:04:08,230
Home.

108
00:04:12,520 --> 00:04:13,110
Shen He!

109
00:04:16,870 --> 00:04:18,440
You mean he showed no symptoms?

110
00:04:21,120 --> 00:04:21,470
Yes.

111
00:04:21,830 --> 00:04:22,560
His Lordship seemed

112
00:04:23,190 --> 00:04:23,830
perfectly fine.

113
00:04:31,160 --> 00:04:32,000
Fine.

114
00:04:33,560 --> 00:04:34,390
Even if it was him,

115
00:04:35,310 --> 00:04:37,120
that wine was merely a warning.

116
00:04:37,800 --> 00:04:38,950
If he keeps investigating,

117
00:04:40,070 --> 00:04:41,760
he'll be digging his own grave.

118
00:04:44,430 --> 00:04:44,990
Shen He.

119
00:04:47,360 --> 00:04:48,320
Shen He!

120
00:04:48,750 --> 00:04:49,560
What's wrong?

121
00:04:49,920 --> 00:04:51,080
Weren't you fine just now?

122
00:04:51,800 --> 00:04:52,240
I...

123
00:04:56,800 --> 00:04:57,390
It's nothing.

124
00:04:59,630 --> 00:05:01,350
Then why are you suddenly
walking so fast?

125
00:05:01,830 --> 00:05:02,680
I have long legs.

126
00:05:03,240 --> 00:05:05,240
Then why the long face?

127
00:05:08,430 --> 00:05:09,440
I have a long face too.

128
00:05:11,240 --> 00:05:12,640
Don't tell me

129
00:05:12,800 --> 00:05:13,720
you're upset

130
00:05:13,720 --> 00:05:15,120
because I didn't

131
00:05:15,720 --> 00:05:16,950
answer your question earlier.

132
00:05:17,720 --> 00:05:18,440
Of course not.

133
00:05:20,830 --> 00:05:21,390
Ouch!

134
00:05:23,390 --> 00:05:24,120
Shen He.

135
00:05:24,800 --> 00:05:25,680
I twisted my ankle.

136
00:05:27,560 --> 00:05:27,800
But...

137
00:05:28,750 --> 00:05:29,950
Weren't you fine just now?

138
00:05:30,430 --> 00:05:31,030
What happened?

139
00:05:31,310 --> 00:05:33,120
I was rushing to catch up with you.

140
00:05:35,240 --> 00:05:36,270
It hurts so much.

141
00:05:36,750 --> 00:05:37,590
I can't walk anymore.

142
00:05:37,720 --> 00:05:38,350
Let me take a look.

143
00:05:42,390 --> 00:05:44,080
Molten iron fireworks!

144
00:05:50,860 --> 00:05:52,570
♪Time passes slowly♪

145
00:05:52,570 --> 00:05:54,620
♪Through spring, fall,
winter, and summer♪

146
00:05:54,980 --> 00:05:56,450
♪The tenderness in my eyes♪

147
00:05:56,480 --> 00:05:57,660
♪Is reserved for you alone♪

148
00:05:57,680 --> 00:05:58,830
What's this?

149
00:05:58,960 --> 00:06:00,520
♪Through life's ups and downs♪

150
00:06:00,520 --> 00:06:02,390
♪Unafraid of storms or worldly clamor♪

151
00:06:02,390 --> 00:06:03,160
My answer.

152
00:06:03,170 --> 00:06:04,600
♪Being together in this life♪

153
00:06:04,600 --> 00:06:07,750
♪Is the best answer of all♪

154
00:06:09,520 --> 00:06:11,040
♪From dawn till dusk♪

155
00:06:11,050 --> 00:06:13,210
♪May we share the years together♪

156
00:06:13,470 --> 00:06:14,970
♪Day after day, year after year♪

157
00:06:15,060 --> 00:06:17,080
♪Treasuring every tender moment♪

158
00:06:17,390 --> 00:06:19,010
♪In this vast world♪

159
00:06:19,020 --> 00:06:21,480
♪How fortunate I am to have met you♪

160
00:06:21,480 --> 00:06:22,930
♪For the rest of our lives♪

161
00:06:22,930 --> 00:06:25,260
♪May love and longing stay with us♪

162
00:06:25,430 --> 00:06:27,020
♪From dawn till dusk♪

163
00:06:27,040 --> 00:06:29,140
♪Cherishing life's simple beauty♪

164
00:06:29,360 --> 00:06:30,890
♪Day after day, year after year♪

165
00:06:30,890 --> 00:06:33,230
♪Living out a grand love story♪

166
00:06:33,480 --> 00:06:35,080
♪With the world
as beautiful as a painting♪

167
00:06:35,080 --> 00:06:37,510
♪You are my whole world♪

168
00:06:37,510 --> 00:06:39,460
♪With a lifetime of devotion♪

169
00:06:40,020 --> 00:06:43,900
♪I'll cherish having met him
in this life♪

170
00:07:14,400 --> 00:07:16,680
Fate may have chosen someone else,

171
00:07:16,680 --> 00:07:17,880
but the one I choose

172
00:07:18,680 --> 00:07:19,350
is you.

173
00:07:20,480 --> 00:07:22,120
Oh, come on.

174
00:07:23,800 --> 00:07:25,040
Don't be fooled by Fire-Shielding Guy.

175
00:07:25,040 --> 00:07:26,320
He usually seems so cold,

176
00:07:26,510 --> 00:07:28,760
but he's full of sweet talk.

177
00:07:30,750 --> 00:07:32,760
And you have the nerve to tease me?

178
00:07:34,360 --> 00:07:35,910
Someone's always saying,

179
00:07:36,800 --> 00:07:38,150
"I'm a traditional man."

180
00:07:40,000 --> 00:07:40,590
So?

181
00:07:40,820 --> 00:07:42,540
Does blindfolding someone with a ribbon
make it any less traditional?

182
00:07:45,070 --> 00:07:45,510
Hey.

183
00:07:47,480 --> 00:07:48,910
That's my answer.

184
00:07:49,390 --> 00:07:49,950
Whatever.

185
00:07:55,480 --> 00:07:57,200
Give the younger brother a chance.

186
00:08:00,270 --> 00:08:01,320
(In my previous life,)

187
00:08:01,600 --> 00:08:02,240
(I distinctly heard)

188
00:08:02,240 --> 00:08:03,760
(that those two women
were foolish and miserable,)

189
00:08:04,390 --> 00:08:06,120
(completely manipulated by Xiang.)

190
00:08:07,160 --> 00:08:07,680
(But in this life,)

191
00:08:07,680 --> 00:08:09,200
(why do they seem
like completely different people?)

192
00:08:11,920 --> 00:08:12,470
Third Young Master,

193
00:08:12,750 --> 00:08:13,760
how did you get burned so badly?

194
00:08:14,190 --> 00:08:15,060
Keep your voice down.

195
00:08:17,040 --> 00:08:17,800
Don't let anyone find out.

196
00:08:22,950 --> 00:08:24,130
Burned?

197
00:08:24,230 --> 00:08:25,480
(I almost forgot.)

198
00:08:25,480 --> 00:08:26,390
(In my previous life,)

199
00:08:26,390 --> 00:08:27,680
(Shen He's biggest troubles)

200
00:08:28,000 --> 00:08:29,760
(began with this very incident.)

201
00:08:30,390 --> 00:08:32,470
The Marquis's Manor
is abusing its power!

202
00:08:32,870 --> 00:08:35,230
My daughter was murdered
while she was alive,

203
00:08:35,510 --> 00:08:37,440
and her body was burned after her death.

204
00:08:38,150 --> 00:08:40,920
She can't even rest in peace!

205
00:08:45,840 --> 00:08:46,750
Didn't I tell you

206
00:08:47,600 --> 00:08:49,200
never to get involved
in a coroner's work again?

207
00:08:50,390 --> 00:08:52,200
I just want to uncover the truth.

208
00:08:54,200 --> 00:08:55,590
Why won't any of you believe me?

209
00:08:56,390 --> 00:08:57,080
I believe you.

210
00:09:03,220 --> 00:09:05,100
(Cheng)

211
00:09:05,630 --> 00:09:07,630
History is about to repeat itself.

212
00:09:08,870 --> 00:09:10,680
If I help the Shen brothers

213
00:09:11,600 --> 00:09:13,110
out of trouble
like I did in my previous life,

214
00:09:13,870 --> 00:09:15,520
they'll see me in a different light.

215
00:09:16,720 --> 00:09:17,750
Once I have both men

216
00:09:17,750 --> 00:09:18,800
on my side,

217
00:09:19,890 --> 00:09:21,500
Yuyuan, Shutiao,

218
00:09:22,120 --> 00:09:23,430
nothing you do will matter.

219
00:09:24,600 --> 00:09:25,990
Now that I've been reborn,

220
00:09:26,670 --> 00:09:28,750
I'm the one writing this story.

221
00:09:29,870 --> 00:09:30,990
How can you possibly compete with me?

222
00:09:43,360 --> 00:09:44,040
Tomorrow morning,

223
00:09:45,270 --> 00:09:46,110
tell them

224
00:09:46,720 --> 00:09:47,950
that if they want justice,

225
00:09:48,510 --> 00:09:49,990
they should make a scene
outside the Marquis's Manor.

226
00:09:50,630 --> 00:09:51,080
Yes.

227
00:10:00,670 --> 00:10:02,230
Old Madam is in excellent health,

228
00:10:02,480 --> 00:10:03,630
and your pulse is steady.

229
00:10:03,840 --> 00:10:04,870
You could live another fifty years

230
00:10:05,120 --> 00:10:06,750
and still be around
to hold your great-grandchildren.

231
00:10:08,960 --> 00:10:10,560
Another fifty years?

232
00:10:10,960 --> 00:10:12,440
You certainly know what to say.

233
00:10:14,150 --> 00:10:16,350
Shutiao looks rather thin to me.

234
00:10:16,840 --> 00:10:17,450
Why don't we

235
00:10:17,670 --> 00:10:18,870
have Zhang check her pulse too

236
00:10:18,870 --> 00:10:19,810
and help improve her health?

237
00:10:20,240 --> 00:10:21,520
That way, our family

238
00:10:21,680 --> 00:10:23,990
might welcome a new baby soon.

239
00:10:30,750 --> 00:10:31,230
Old Madam!

240
00:10:31,550 --> 00:10:32,040
Old Madam!

241
00:10:32,340 --> 00:10:33,180
Something terrible has happened!

242
00:10:33,550 --> 00:10:34,920
A crowd has gathered outside the manor.

243
00:10:34,980 --> 00:10:36,140
They're accusing
the Third Young Master...

244
00:10:36,650 --> 00:10:37,480
The Third Young Master...

245
00:10:37,480 --> 00:10:38,950
of setting fire
to their daughter's remains.

246
00:10:39,670 --> 00:10:40,200
What?

247
00:10:48,730 --> 00:10:51,050
♪No matter how
the universe changes tomorrow♪

248
00:10:51,050 --> 00:10:58,250
♪Right now,
I just want to stay by your side♪

249
00:10:58,250 --> 00:11:03,450
♪Let this kiss and this dream
last until we're old♪

250
00:11:04,650 --> 00:11:09,690
♪And hold on to all
the tenderness of this moment♪

251
00:11:11,050 --> 00:11:16,130
♪Following this heartbeat,
we'll retrace our steps♪

252
00:11:17,490 --> 00:11:22,610
♪As time goes by,
all I need is your gaze♪

253
00:11:23,890 --> 00:11:27,250
♪One dream until our hair turns gray♪

254
00:11:46,010 --> 00:11:49,370
♪One dream until our hair turns gray♪
